# Before each mission, a preview card: the mission (2 of 3...), its name, a
# strip map of the battlefield - enemy ground hatched red, the fence, four
# barracks, our pad and hangar, a yellow "you are here" arrow over the
# chopper - and a one-line brief. A fresh press of fire skips it; the map is
# gone once play starts.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
press fire 2
wait 70
screenshot card
# the arrow over the chopper at the base (world x 2880 / 12 = map x 240)
expect-color card 272 120 0xFC3
# the nearest barracks' red roof (world x 2240 / 12 = 186)
expect-color card 218 124 0xD42
# a hut's door, the enemy ground's red hatching, our blue
expect-color card 67 127 0x111
expect-color card 100 128 0xD42
expect-color card 260 128 0x36B
press fire 1
wait-serial "state=2" 10
wait 12
screenshot play
expect-serial "state=1[\s\S]*state=2"
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR"
